{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54909","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，鸟鹊（辛本、川本、京本作「乌鸟」）蓦然惊。\n内有奸臣连外贼，堤防大（京本、辛本、川本作「苦」）战血成坑，谋反（京本作「叛」）害英明（川本作「其身」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}